      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（春）”。\n名将怒涛与好歌剧的一战，\n在宝冢纪念前就实现了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a67df57272a7ce3ee66e208a40347024175d72e6c209be2987516972bcd34a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
