      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念。以往总是跟在好歌剧身后的\n名将怒涛首次被她第一个点名，\n站上与好歌剧平等的立场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acd1cc0b1d46501bd831326f1d947e9276d18b28d8fc507004628d338d00066a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
