    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760809068d153550ed79177b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在半年前，当爱慕织姬脱队时，\n好歌剧之所以会说“唯有等待一途”……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d28b2f54cd124edc274ed43a3ec103c147cb73a699c439fdaf818444dbb57dea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058414.json",
