    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d30a9896ecf461a6d6311dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "指的就是要等待名将怒涛的觉醒。\n而现在──正是名将怒涛必须展现\n她已完全进入巅峰期的表现之时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ae18683ca8e839f65130f4a3528c3bbe5a3ad5c562b6a9f349137fa4e15760",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058414.json",
