      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这场天皇赏（秋）之中，\n名将怒涛不只想受到好歌剧认可，\n更希望成为她的伙伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5bdfe9811f1cfd415f54eb79cbdc21aa90348cc75db5e1243613a694e5037a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
