      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，那个“缺乏自信”的性格，\n正是专属于她的武器。她背负起一路走来\n从未间断过的努力，踏上草地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72b7bcfe31cc829b5c6b399b5b6d161eff13c37be0478ddc5d49cd32c8286592",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
