    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfdbb893b7dc223f08b7c456",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛被送到保健室之后，\n得知了一个惊人的事实。\n原来她的身体还尚未进入“巅峰期”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6576dfe46a2cfacd1ddcea70594b16b6047d254a1425c5fd482c01d1005cad08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
