    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d8a19bf07cfdea155601d47",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“巅峰期”是指赛马娘的成长期。在进入这段\n期间前就拔腿狂奔，那昏倒也是在所难免……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b5e377fb9f358663c575f78873921c43e532bb1231d76ab8ceed3ec9d25ae25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058418.json",
      "json_path": [
