    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45e98d46d0a1fc5403cd14ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，不知放弃为何物的名将怒涛，\n决定要在不勉强自己的状况下\n一点一滴去累积更多竞赛的成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "744d70b689be482ff7e0bb946bcf0a444e1b0176bdbe86cb59dc17d8083fb950",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058418.json",
      "json_path": [
