    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc2ff696e748862d151f044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她却因惊讶过度而哇哇大叫并陷入混乱。\n名将怒涛很快地便耗尽体力和精力，\n然后就这样昏倒了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f32501b62c3187ecd92cf05c42f7415c3d1914e4c0c25e01b0d761b8c83dc96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
