    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f17da985d98cd661d6ff394",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛在现阶段根本不可能赢过好歌剧，\n最后搞得自己精疲力尽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "127ffa9633a6e964c22b4c0483a14533a22a441fab49a6031ec2960fe6f5d369",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
