      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛以为自己就要被训练员抛弃了，\n于是打算离开他身边。不过她还是受到\n慰留，并决定继续赛马娘生涯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed1105d3066ef28aa945bfef3cbefe140ee9706e8081fa2bf96af578c6ce242",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
