    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bff10c7e8c73a2ec21228036",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的身体也慢慢出现了进入巅峰期的征兆。\n照这样子来看，把德比设定为下一个目标\n似乎也无不可──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c97a82cab7aefdb457f92608ef5d9bf5846caaeb0bd6b60f62570f942009975b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
