      "uid": "zhcn:9ba38c2aa869fe63dca749ef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过她吓得铆足全力拒绝了。即使体能逐渐\n觉醒，心灵却还有待加强。训练员决定\n要让她再多累积一些竞赛经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63cde3bdc3a54499f4c4c9e0398efd82645a493d4731a824f05bc6a0ec1037a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
