    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e50b2b359115fe7acc7a78",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛在“日本德比”赢过了爱慕织姬。\n但却没有对象可以让她献上这场胜利……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a039bc1f388aa57b4d67aca45ce97debb574de3046ad3be617ef2a9deb88e2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
