    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc94ca304a0baa93b1671226",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬赞赏了她的精彩表现后旋即离去。\n看着她的背影，名将怒涛期盼自己\n有一天也能为了别人而跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35f4b9a646fa6a19dca2d0244a8be7e4d8a473fc274e3d6969bd350e201c9c0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
