      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时却传来坏消息。同期的爱慕织姬\n必须暂时脱队。苦于脚的发炎症状，\n使她不知何时才能回到赛场上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "667e3e2f0540add6c16e00271ac31bcb3dc3e1381bfe1b2374004fcd594b3e78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
