      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧悲观地表示“唯有等待一途”。\n同时，在有她们两人的保护下，\n而总是显得很懦弱的名将怒涛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb586830a3b32deae24771a53d2b0ff0c60512049618194c6bb7de9bcbd0e54e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
