      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她终于觉醒了。为了变成强悍的赛马娘，\n好在GⅠ战线中守护好歌剧，\n她决定要先进军年初的“日经新春杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bb61b8b5eedc5cb0e60dbd8d75eeded89faf410ce2c2c5e7c4428713ad84158",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
