    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60377ec7f4c881e7cbdb7f75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当她干劲十足地表示再来要参加春季GⅠ时，\n她的挚友待兼福来却阻挡在前方。\nGⅠ前哨战的舞台就决定是“金鯱赏”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a09fd6ce6638aee3ce7e2f9b34fa5ac671a8ba6f5d3f88ccca983784a97f09bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
